window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Betrayal surrounds her. Doom beckons her. Yet she will hunt one last time.</b></p> <p>Captured, heartbroken, shackled in torturous iron mittens that keep her shade deeply suppressed, Ayleth knows Fendrel keeps her alive for one purpose: She is his only remaining weapon against the resurrected Dread Odile. Once her task is complete, she will be executed. It's as simple as that.</p> <p>But Ayleth isn't about to give in that easily.</p> <p>Meanwhile, Gerard is held prisoner in his own castle by his uncle's orders - Fendrel must keep his nephew alive in order to force the ancient prophecy into completion. However, Gerard sees a different path before him, and he is resolved to follow it to the end.</p> <p>As the forces of the Witch Queen wreak havoc across the land, can Ayleth and Gerard come to terms with the truth of their pasts...and face their destinies with courage?</p>"; 
